{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever saw a sign and thought that it was mondo cool? Ever wanted to learn how to build signs or to simulate the fun of using power tools? Or do you just want to simulate a real-world job?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sign Craft: Simulator</strong> is a 3D first-person game that allows you to build signs, using various tools, equipment and materials. You start off at a sign shop as an entry level Sign Technician. In the beginning you complete basic tasks, earning experience which allows your boss to entrust you with more skilled jobs, such as electrical work. Includes <i>real-life</i> skill building, such as <u>picking up trash</u> and <u>sweeping</u>!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633550/extras/86a3b43d0f54d4bae0d60e3496eba99f.webp?t=1768491491\" width=480 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633550/extras/e33a819a61bd44523065bacd8c8118d2.webp?t=1768491491\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Utilize equipment such as drop saws and wall saws</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633550/extras/e33a819a61bd44523065bacd8c8118d2.webp?t=1768491491\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Cut, weld, squeegee and screw materials together to construct signs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633550/extras/e33a819a61bd44523065bacd8c8118d2.webp?t=1768491491\" width=32 height=32 /></span>A variety of power and hand tools are at your disposal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\